 <title>Telegram macOS</title>
+<description>New:&lt;br&gt;• Dictator is now available in Russian, Ukrainian, Spanish, Italian and Persian&lt;br&gt;• The AI assistant's duck is drawn by Dictator, so Telegram no longer keeps 3D rendering memory&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Telegram uses much less memory: a more compact memory allocator, theme icons drawn for your screen, and an emoji panel that frees its data when unused&lt;br&gt;• The duck rests when nothing happens and pauses while Telegram is in the background&lt;br&gt;• The AI assistant says up front when it can't read the current chat&lt;br&gt;• Group call audio no longer stutters when the Mac is busy&lt;br&gt;• Telegram keeps far fewer threads alive while idle&lt;br&gt;• Document, code and 3D preview services shut down when unused and release memory under pressure&lt;br&gt;• The sandboxed services for animations, code highlighting and calls can no longer reach the clipboard, open links or other system services&lt;br&gt;• 3D model previews load in order instead of timing out while you scroll&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• GIFs, stickers and video previews could freeze after a decoding error&lt;br&gt;• One misbehaving widget could stop every widget in the app&lt;br&gt;• Document previews could stop working for good after a storage error&lt;br&gt;• Updates were downloaded in full instead of as a small delta for people who changed Telegram's Dock icon&lt;br&gt;• Linked channel posts stay visible while chat history reloads&lt;br&gt;• Channel action buttons line up with the message composer&lt;br&gt;• Seller gift-offer receipts show as separate messages&lt;br&gt;• Managing collectible gift sales in Wallet works again, and the gift preview matches My Profile&lt;br&gt;• Gift offers show precise expiry times, with Withdraw inside the offer card&lt;br&gt;</description>
+<pubDate>2026-17-11 19:36:13</pubDate>
